    {
      "id": "c-shiji-116-xinanyi:p010",
      "text": "西南夷君長以百數，獨夜郎、滇受王印。滇小邑，最寵焉。",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "mentions": [
